        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb, leap, and persevere. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of May on a journey to conquer the peak of a mysterious mountain. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This pixel-art adventure combines precision platforming with fluid parkour-inspired movement, challenging your reflexes while surrounding you with charming environments. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every step upward brings new trials—perilous gaps, shifting ledges, and obstacles that demand patience and skill. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At its heart, this is a game about determination. No enemies, no combat—just you, the mountain, and the will to keep climbing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• cool movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• cool pixel art</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >• dog</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's a short game for a cozy evening</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hope you enjoy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032790/extras/3d33b51a29aeac2c80fb0f551fc4b5cf.avif?t=1759906877\" width=152 height=82 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032790/extras/f62fcc52dcb8ad20ea00b54056cebe29.poster.avif?t=1759906877\" width=1152 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032790/extras/f62fcc52dcb8ad20ea00b54056cebe29.webm?t=1759906877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4032790/extras/f62fcc52dcb8ad20ea00b54056cebe29.mp4?t=1759906877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
